      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_군_2.중재군_군명",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "NON TREATMENT ARM",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 38,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_군_2.중재군_상세내용",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Observation",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 39,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "9. 대상자선정기준_대상자 포함기준_내용",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "1. Acquisition of consent form 2. Total cholesterol level of less than 220mg/dl Should have at least one of categories listed in the item 3. or 4. 3. Clearly diagnosed as diabetes and should have at least two of those listed as follows; - Age ; male 45YO or more, female 55YO or more - Current smoker - Diagnosed as hypertension - Low HDL cholesterol levels <40 mg/dl - Abdominal obesity (male; 90 cm or more, female; 85 cm or more of waist circumferences) 4. Non-diabetics, but calculated 10-year-risk for cardiovascular disease (offered by NCEP-III guideline) equals or more than 20 % and diagnosed as metabolic syndrome.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 40,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "9. 대상자선정기준_대상자 제외기준",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "1. Age of 80 YO or more 2. History of uncontrolled endocrinologic diseases; such as hypothyroidism, hypopituitarism, or others. 3. Pregnancy 4. Azotemia 5. HIV positive 6. Abnormal serum levels of liver (AST, ALT) and muscle (CK) enzymes 7. History of neoplasm 8. History of overt cardiovascular disease 9. Hear failure 10. Triglyceride levels > 400mg/dl 11. Total cholesterol levels < 150mg/dl 12. HbA1C levels > 11.0%",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 41,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "10. 결과변수_주요결과변수_1.주요결과변수_평가항목",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Myocardial infarction, stroke, Cardiovascular death, Hospitalization due to unstable angina, TIA, the development of atherosclerotic",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
